DROP TABLE IF EXISTS tbl_textos;

CREATE TABLE tbl_textos (
    id int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
    id_seccion int(11) NOT NULL,
    paginaPadre varchar(100) CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_spanish_ci NOT NULL,
    identificacion varchar(50) CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_spanish_ci NULL,
    texto mediumtext CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_spanish_ci NOT NULL,
    INDEX fk_tbl_textos_tbl_secciones (id_seccion),
    CONSTRAINT fk_tbl_textos_tbl_secciones FOREIGN KEY (id_seccion) REFERENCES tbl_secciones (id)
) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COLLATE=utf8mb4_spanish_ci;


(29, 'principiosYValores', 'Commitment', 'The school is committed to developing, through continuous improvement and the efforts of a team of workers who study, research, attend to and provide the best educational services to the community, guaranteeing the quality and excellence of learning in the life projects of students who have discovered skills and abilities, and who enhance them with autonomy, freedom and identity motivated by the desire to meet their expectations, the achievement of the goals and objectives of the institution, so that they freely transform a true education that develops their personality autonomously, appropriating knowledge in their practical life as proposed by John Dewey and as a result of individual, family and community benefit.' ),
(29, 'principiosYValores', 'Honesty', 'To act responsibly and ethically in accordance with current regulations in all aspects related to the development and interaction of the institution´s activities with society. To be transparent in all matters, and to ensure that each of the policies adopted within the school, as well as the commitments made, are supported by defined, integrated processes and executed according to the proposed quality standards, through a defined structure of institutional operations and their impact on society.' ),
(29, 'principiosYValores', 'Liberty', 'It is the answer to the ideological syllogism of what is expected in relation to what one is. Our students undergo a process of accompaniment that allows them to identify and define themselves in order to be free, so that, empowered, they feel efficient when making decisions; therefore, we always seek and prioritize the truth without restrictions, to produce knowledge and the progress of society with awareness of their interests, rights, duties and political responsibilities with a high sense of collective responsibility.' ),
(29, 'principiosYValores', 'Equity', 'The pedagogical dimension of equity in education underpins its strategic approach to addressing persistent inequalities despite global policies aimed at expanding opportunities. We uphold a concept of comprehensive equity that incorporates the principles and goals of education in Colombia, along with social inclusion for participation and empowerment. This concept is grounded in critical pedagogies, capacity building, and student-centered education, encompassing inclusive and dialogical educational processes to strengthen the agency of non-traditional students within a virtual pedagogical model. This empowers them to learn and to reverse accumulated educational and social exclusions. This dimension is key to optimizing strategies for expanding accessibility and coverage, which the General Education Law so frequently addresses in light of the failures experienced by traditional students. This is evidenced in the analysis of innovative practices presented in this educational project.' ),
(29, 'principiosYValores', 'Responsibility', 'It emerges as an alternative to meet the needs of those who, being different, seek to be welcomed and supported in their extracurricular activities in the arts, sports, science, technology, and research that shape the contemporary world. These individuals, curious and committed, wish to engage with this world, but conventional educational norms often deny them the space to fulfill the dreams and aspirations that set them apart. UNICAB recognizes this need and aligns itself with the desire of those whose life projects aim to transcend to other realms. They are supported by a team of dedicated teachers who guide the teaching and learning processes with sensitivity and awareness, making them flexible through virtual platforms and humanizing the process through an eco-systemic and research-based pedagogical model.' ),

(30, 'cartiHome', 'Mission', '<b>CARTI EXPLORE</b> It is the High Performance Center for Talent and Intelligence, innovative and relevant, established as a highly humanistic center for talent development for children and young people, where formal education, culture and sport converge, with the redefinition of learning so that human beings develop their skills, abilities and talents, solve their problems equitably and expand their opportunities in pursuit of happiness.' ),
(30, 'cartiHome', 'Vision', '<b>CARTI EXPLORE</b> By 2030, it will be recognized regionally and nationally as a school established as a high-performance training center, a model in redefining educational paradigms, a leader in talent development and virtual education, consistently applying innovative approaches, inspiring the strengthening of sports, cultural, scientific, and social disciplines, fostering 21st-century skills, and celebrating creativity, research, and effort to give meaning to its students lives.' ),
(30, 'cartiHome', 'Institutional Principles', '<b>CARTI EXPLORA</b>, It promotes the comprehensive development of its students in a completely innovative context, through a physical, digital, curricular and training structure so that the learning outcome of its students is autonomous and conscious in a learning process defined with a flexible, dynamic, relevant teaching methodology based on ethical principles so that together with the development of capacities, skills and abilities in specific areas, they can have an excellent performance in their' ),
(30, 'cartiHome', 'Commitment', 'The school is committed to developing, through continuous improvement and the efforts of a team of workers who study, research, attend to, and provide the best educational services to the community, the quality and excellence of learning in the life projects of students who have discovered skills and abilities, and who enhance them with autonomy, freedom, and identity, motivated by the desire to meet their expectations, the achievement of the institution´s goals and objectives, so that they freely transform a true education that develops their personality autonomously, appropriating knowledge in their practical life as proposed by John Dewey, and as a result, individual, family, and community benefit.' ),
(30, 'cartiHome', 'Ethics', 'To act responsibly and honestly in accordance with current regulations in all aspects related to the development and interaction of the institution´s activities with society. To be transparent in all matters, and to ensure that each of the policies adopted within the school, as well as the commitments made, are supported by defined, integrated processes and executed in accordance with the proposed quality standards, through a defined structure of institutional operations and their impact on society.' ),
(30, 'cartiHome', 'Liberty', 'It is the answer to the ideological syllogism of what is expected in relation to what one is. Our students undergo a process of accompaniment that allows them to identify and define themselves in order to be free, so that, empowered, they feel efficient when making decisions; therefore, we always seek and prioritize the truth without restrictions, to produce knowledge and the progress of society with awareness of their interests, rights, duties and political responsibilities with a high sense of collective responsibility.' ),
(30, 'cartiHome', 'Equity', 'The pedagogical dimension of equity in education underpins its strategic scale for addressing the inequalities that persist despite policies aimed at expanding opportunities worldwide. We support a concept of comprehensive equity that incorporates the principles and aims of education in Colombia, along with social inclusion for participation and empowerment. This concept is grounded in critical pedagogies, capacity building, and student-centered education, encompassing inclusive and dialogical educational processes to strengthen the agency of non-traditional students within a disruptive pedagogical model. This model aims both to facilitate learning and to reverse accumulated educational and social exclusions. This dimension is key to optimizing strategies for expanding accessibility and coverage, which the General Education Law so frequently addresses in light of the failures experienced by traditional students. This is evidenced in the analysis of innovative practices present in this educational project.' ),
(30, 'cartiHome', 'Responsabilidad', 'It arises as an alternative to meet the needs of those who, being different, request to be welcomed and accompanied in their educational processes and activities to strengthen the talents associated with the arts, sports, science, technology, and research that develops the contemporary world, in which they curiously and committedly want to develop, but which, due to educational conventions, are not allowed spaces to fulfill dreams and concerns that make them different.<br><br><b>CARTI EXPLORE</b> Find that scheme and join the desire of those who, because of their life project, want to transcend to other scenarios, accompanied by a team of committed teachers who guide the teaching and learning processes with sensitivity and awareness and make them flexible through experiences of exploration and deepening of talent, humanizing the process, through an eco-systemic and investigative pedagogical model.'),
(30, 'cartiHome', 'Pertinence', 'There will be ongoing self-evaluation of the school´s potential regarding its strategies and methodologies in various areas, including intellectual, socio-emotional, and practical aspects. This involves the quality of relationships, testimonials from current and future graduates, and family participation, all aimed at cultivating a critical perspective on contemporary society. This will foster continuous redesign based on democracy and participation, promoting collaborative work among families, teachers, students, and the community. Therefore, CARTI EXPLORA, under the leadership of its directors, will consolidate educational quality and suitability through continuous pedagogical reflection, the adoption of more effective teaching methodologies and techniques, and the ongoing professional development of its staff, thus making our pedagogical model truly organic.'),

